				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$V=[\mathrm{L}\times \mathrm{W}\times \mathrm{H}]/2$$\end{document}V=[L×W×H]/2. The area under the curve was calculated with GraphPad Prism. Mice were euthanized under ethical endpoints (< 1500mm3).
